  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection, shelter/NFIs and Multi-Sectoral response for the refugees and internally displaced persons in the Far North, Northwest and Southwest regions of Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide protection, shelter/non-food items, and multi-sector refugee assistance to vulnerable communities in Cameroon. This UNHCR project strengthens protection monitoring and response, supports refugees and host communities through a multi-sectoral response, and provides shelter as well as non-food items. The project provides life-saving assistance to 5,000 people in the protection sector, 30,000 people in the Shelter/NFI sector, and 13,200 through Multi-Sector Refugee Assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
